# Delivery quality

- Follow `BUILD_INCREMENTS.md`; do not skip ahead without user approval.
- Offline workout + meal logging is first-class; use Dexie transactions + outbox.
- Every FoodItem needs source + provenance; meal logs snapshot nutrients.
- Progress photos: private Storage + RLS path `{user_id}/...` only.
- AI imports: propose → human review → promote; store provenance.
- Prefer simple protocol modeling (group id + protocol enum) before auto-progression engines.
- Add tests for sync idempotency when implementing offline kernel.
- No drive-by refactors or unrelated files; match existing docs’ language.
